    "en": "In the past 8 hours the DSH ecosystem added 46 plugins and 583 stars, alongside the dsh 0.1.7-alpha.2 release; growth is concentrated in desktop projects (dataelement +139, anywhere-labs +136 stars), while 12,717 of 15,918 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days, leaving the health score at 38.",
